          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nabonye mw isahu umwambaro mwiza uvuye i Shinari, na shekeli z’ifeza amajana abiri, n’ikigabane c’izahabu kirivye shekeli mirongwitanu; ndaheza ndavyifuza, ndabitwara; kandi bizītse mu kuzimu mw ihema ryanje, n’ifeza ziri musi yavyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.21",
