        {
          "text": "Maze Yosuwa aravuga, ati N’iki catumye udutēza amagorwa? Nawe uyu musi Uhoraho aragutera amagorwa. Maz’ Abisirayeli bose bamutera amabuye; babicisha amabuye, barabaturira. ",
          "type": "text",
